{"version":1,"content":"<p>OpenAI正式發佈兩款全新人工智能模型GPT-6.2 Astra和GPT-6.2 Sol，並宣稱新模型在編程、科研、專業辦公以及計算機操作等多個領域實現顯著進步。與此同時，新模型能夠以更少的Token消耗完成更多任務，讓用户在現有使用額度下獲得更高的工作效率。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586832.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T21:00:38.638942+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T20:32:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T20:53:53.290522+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T20:53:53.290522+00:00","content_hash":"7fc88ad219b3bbc359435a017209de123ef6a4430dbbef12e6806cfb1303f41e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}